# Fir tap 2026-10-03 (daily loop): 48 H45 restacks = every Fir H45 lane whose first rep was READ today (range_done < 177/177) and has no job queued (Fir pending 0 < floor 12).
# Lines are verbatim from docs/plans/passh45_submit_fir.txt. Gate: aborts (no submit) if any n=45 checkpoint CFGSIG lacks ".ep1" or if any job is already pending.
# Run as: ./cluster/deploy/duo_run.sh fir "$(grep -v "^#" docs/plans/launch/passh45_restack_fir_2026-10-03.sh)"
